{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y1`, `x1`, and `y2`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the `model` block so that every parameter receives its original built-in prior before the parameter is used in deterministic computations or likelihood terms. The deterministic variance computations were moved into a local block after the priors. No data variables were added or modified; `data_safe.json` is the supplied data. The protected observations remain top-level data and are each observed exactly once with built-in `normal` sampling statements. `y1` is observed before it is used as a predictor in the likelihood for `x1`.
","model_safe_stan":"data {
  int<lower=1> N;
  vector[N] x1; // Complete observation
  vector[N] y1; // Complete observation
  vector[N] y2; // Incomplete observation

  int<lower=1> N_grid; // Number of grid points for quantifying functional behavior
  vector[N_grid] y_grid; // Grid points for quantifying functional behavior
}

parameters {
  real mu1;
  real<lower=0> tau1;

  real mu2;
  real<lower=0> tau2;

  real<lower=0> sigma;
}

model {
  mu1 ~ normal(0, 3);
  tau1 ~ normal(0, 1);

  mu2 ~ normal(0, 3);
  tau2 ~ normal(0, 1);

  sigma ~ normal(0, 1);

  {
    real sigma_sq = square(sigma);

    real tau1_sq = square(tau1);
    real sum_sq_1 = tau1_sq + sigma_sq;

    real tau2_sq = square(tau2);
    real sum_sq_2 = tau2_sq + sigma_sq;

    y1 ~ normal(mu1, sqrt(sum_sq_1));
    x1 ~ normal((y1 * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1,
                sqrt(tau1_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_1));

    y2 ~ normal(mu2, sqrt(sum_sq_2));
  }
}

generated quantities {
  // Predict completion of second observation
  vector[N_grid] f1_grid;    // Inferred functional behavior along covariate grid
  vector[N_grid] f2_grid;    // Inferred functional behavior along covariate grid
  array[N_grid] real x2_pred_grid; // Predictive variate behavior along covariate grid

  array[N] real x2_pred;

  {
    real sigma_sq = square(sigma);

    real tau1_sq = square(tau1);
    real sum_sq_1 = tau1_sq + sigma_sq;

    real tau2_sq = square(tau2);
    real sum_sq_2 = tau2_sq + sigma_sq;

    f1_grid = (y_grid * tau1_sq + mu1 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_1;
    f2_grid = (y_grid * tau2_sq + mu2 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_2;

    x2_pred_grid = normal_rng((y_grid * tau2_sq + mu2 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_2,
                              sqrt(tau2_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_2));

    x2_pred = normal_rng((y2 * tau2_sq + mu2 * sigma_sq) / sum_sq_2,
                         sqrt(tau2_sq * sigma_sq / sum_sq_2));
  }
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":3,"N_grid":2,"x1":[3.497216211620378,6.027719880495813,5.143723072959267],"y1":[4.860835774030196,6.551125634749765,3.3363038315689293],"y2":[6.808256229410933,6.981438737732268,4.989343114481347],"y_grid":[1.0,2.0]}","protected_variables":["y1","x1","y2"]}
